    <string name="pepe_setup_title">Linux</string>
    <string name="pepe_setup_intro">pepelauncher runs Arch Linux ARM in proot, without root. Setup downloads the official root filesystem (about 550 MB) from %1$s, checks it, unpacks it (about 2 GB) and updates it with pacman. You can leave this screen; setup keeps running in the background.</string>
